==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Clefable|75}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion; both cards have the Moon Kick attack.
*'''Moon Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Erika's Clefairy|40}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

